{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118170","id":3487618449,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7P4NWR","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118170","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118170.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118170.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118170","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118170/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118170/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118170/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/24c4ec3268b175ade65b4c281b3b0cdccf7c3511","number":118170,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Parse numbers in JSON as integers","user":{"login":"mashumafi","id":1059099,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTkwOTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1059099?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mashumafi","html_url":"https://github.com/mashumafi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mashumafi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mashumafi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mashumafi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mashumafi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mashumafi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mashumafi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mashumafi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mashumafi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mashumafi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"# Problem\r\nThe `JSON::parse` function will parse all numbers as a `double`. This makes rendering strings difficult for me since I rely on the JSON result to tell me the schema. I don't want a value like `{\"number\":5}` rendered as `5.0` instead it should be `5`.\r\n\r\n# Example\r\n\r\n```gd\r\nvar res = JSON.parse_string(\"5\")\r\nprint(res) # prints 5.0 instead of 5\r\n```\r\n\r\n# Solution\r\nI changed the code so that it will output an `int` result if a number is missing the `.`, `e` or `E` character otherwise it falls back to its original behavior of parsing as a double. ","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-04-03T21:49:12Z","updated_at":"2026-04-07T15:57:56Z","closed_at":"2026-04-07T15:45:00Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"12b3051b01dbc361cfe4e00ba88353f4fe77255e","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"mashumafi:json-parse-int","ref":"json-parse-int","repo":{"id":352183149,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnkzNTIxODMxNDk=","name":"godot","full_name":"mashumafi/godot","owner":{"login":"mashumafi","id":1059099,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTkwOTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1059099?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mashumafi","html_url":"https://github.com/mashumafi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mashumaf